 "ez_index": 250,
 "name": "ST45MILITARY.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "As a weapon, the Gundam Mk-II",
  "had no strategic value.",
  "The data needed for development",
  "was stored at Gryps,",
  "and work on its successor",
  "had already begun.",
  "Were it otherwise, it would never",
  "have been handed to pilots",
  "as green as Jerid",
  "and Kacricon.",
  "It is only reasonable to see it",
  "as a prototype for trials toward",
  "the true mass-production model,",
  "or as a flagship",
  "for winning budgets.",
  "But the towering illusion",
  "that was the Gundam",
  "lent political meaning to",
  "the Gundam Mk-II,",
  "a mere idol for propaganda.",
  "And so",
  "Bask was forced to mobilize",
  "the Alexandria--still forming up",
  "and supposedly top secret--",
  "to chase after the AEUG.",
  "But,",
  "whatever the paperwork said,",
  "it was in truth a Gryps fleet",
  "still in the middle of forming.",
  "It had only just begun",
  "fleet training.",
  "The AEUG's situation",
  "was not much different.",
  "They too were pushing their luck,",
  "and their new ship, the Argama,",
  "had engine trouble.",
  "For both, immediate combat",
  "was simply out of the question,",
  "and that strain was passed",
  "straight down to the front line,",
  "where, to carry out orders,",
  "men took reckless risks.",
  "And now, in the midst of war,",
  "negotiations were about to begin.",
  "This negotiation: a farce.",
  "The AEUG and the Titans alike",
  "needed several hours",
  "to ready for battle,",
  "so the negotiations were for both",
  "a convenient way to buy time.",
  "As soon as both were ready,",
  "the fighting would begin.",
  "These negotiations",
  "took the form of the Titans",
  "delivering Colonel Bask Om's",
  "personal letter",
  "to the AEUG.",
  "The envoy who delivered the letter",
  "was named Emma Sheen.",
  "She would later",
  "join the AEUG.",
  "Some call this act",
  "betrayal,",
  "but that is not entirely accurate.",
  "She had a reason",
  "that left her no choice.",
  "Colonel Bask Om,",
  "to retrieve the Gundam Mk-II,",
  "had taken Kamille's parents",
  "hostage.",
  "The envoy bearing that threat",
  "was Emma.",
  "When Emma heard what it said,",
  "her expression",
  "froze.",
  "Emma had not meant",
  "to betray anyone.",
  "Even in war, there are rules",
  "that ought to hold, naturally;",
  "she was trying to uphold them.",
  "Enter Bask Om",
  "Enter the Hizack",
  "Colonel Bask Om,",
  "Jamitov Hymem's trusted",
  "right hand, was the man who",
  "actually built the Titans",
  "as a military organization.",
  "He had fought in the One Year War,",
  "and it is said Zeon torture in the",
  "opening battles damaged his sight.",
  "Rumor had it that he personally",
  "resented the people of space.",
  "As part of the Earth Orbit Fleet,",
  "he intercepted the Delaz Fleet;",
  "then, building on the ships",
  "under him, he founded the Titans.",
  "To him, Jamitov was not so much",
  "a superior as a sponsor who",
  "helped him take his revenge.",
  "Jamitov, like many General Staff",
  "elites, excelled only at politics;",
  "in a mere three years,",
  "he drew vast sums",
  "from the Federation government,",
  "money that could never go public,",
  "making Green Oasis a military base,",
  "a feat of no ordinary skill.",
  "It was likely that temperament",
  "that led him to call",
  "Green Noa 2 \"Gryps.\"",
  "Opinion on Bask as a soldier",
  "remains divided.",
  "Commodore Blex Forer, for one,",
  "in his private memoirs,",
  "\"Bask is a man who never",
  " lived through the One Year War,\"",
  "so he wrote, but going by",
  "his service record,",
  "that is not the case.",
  "At the very least, compared",
  "to the schemer Jamaican Daninghan",
  "and his like,",
  "he was far more a field commander,",
  "one who had won his men's trust",
  "as well.",
  "Gryps and the Gundam Mk-II alike",
  "were his perfect toys",
  "for wiping out a phantom--",
  "the space dwellers, and",
  "the Zeonists he believed",
  "stood behind them.",
  "It was a delusion",
  "born of paranoia,",
  "but if Delaz's uprising gave",
  "that delusion form,",
  "then that was a misfortune.",
  "Indeed, he mistook",
  "the anti-Federation protest",
  "at 30 Bunch for a Zeon uprising",
  "and went so far as to gas it,",
  "directly driving the AEUG",
  "into armed struggle.",
  "Out of fear of monsters,",
  "people often become monsters.",
  "Bask Om was so afraid",
  "of the monster called Zeon",
  "that he imitated only the worst",
  "of the Zabi family--",
  "an unfortunate man.",
  "The world bore him far less",
  "ill will",
  "than he imagined,",
  "but each time he raised a hand,",
  "the \"Zeon\" he hated grew.",
  "It was nothing but a vicious circle.",
  "Then again, the Bidans, taken",
  "hostage by that unfortunate man",
  "to win back the Gundam Mk-II,",
  "and the colony folk he killed",
  "had no reason whatsoever",
  "to feel sorry for Bask.",
  "Enter the Hizack",
  "The mobile suit that formed",
  "the core of the Titans back then",
  "was the Hizack.",
  "As its name and looks suggest,",
  "it is a machine descended",
  "from Zeon's MS-06 Zaku.",
  "Energy CAPs,",
  "Luna Titanium,",
  "field motor drive--",
  "in such obvious technologies",
  "the Federation held the edge,",
  "but in the finer technical points,",
  "such as operating rates",
  "or the precision of parts,",
  "it could barely hold a candle",
  "to Zeon.",
  "The Federation Forces, of course,",
  "were well aware of this,",
  "and after the war, first of all,",
  "the arms makers and the Forces",
  "fought desperately to bring",
  "Zeon engineers into their fold.",
  "The result was the Hizack,",
  "made standard issue in 0084.",
  "Fusing MS-06 and RGM-79",
  "technology, this mobile suit",
  "could not power",
  "multiple beam weapons,",
  "but thanks to",
  "the Federation's trademark",
  "high heat dissipation, stable",
  "generator operation",
  "was made possible.",
  "That was not all.",
  "Its high mobility, born of",
  "whole legs serving as vector",
  "nozzles, a layout inherited",
  "from the MS-06R High Mobility Zaku;",
  "hovering ability like the MS-09's;",
  "versatile arms for everything from",
  "base assaults to anti-MS combat;",
  "and its honest handling",
  "were all rated highly",
  "by pilots in the field.",
  "Nothing about it stood out,",
  "but it was an all-purpose weapon.",
  "The GM Custom's air superiority.",
  "The GM Cannon II's firepower.",
  "The GM Quel's fighting power",
  "inside a colony.",
  "And the GM II's mass-producibility.",
  "That was the Hizack.",
  "It would long remain in use, from",
  "civilian versions to units diverted",
  "to Zeon remnants' armed revolts.",
  "Its looks were all too",
  "reminiscent of the Zaku,",
  "drawing a backlash from the media",
  "and anti-Zeonists,",
  "but high performance mattered",
  "far more for this machine.",
  "Amid a trend of mobile suits",
  "growing huge, like dinosaurs,",
  "there was the Hizack, which went",
  "back to the mobile suit's original",
  "thesis: powered armor",
  "for use in space.",
  "That such a machine",
  "came to be",
  "was partly due to the Federation's",
  "desperation to close",
  "the gap with Zeon,",
  "but it showed the flexible",
  "thinking of the ex-Zeon",
  "engineers who built it",
  "Indeed,",
  "the RX-78NT1, the RX-78GP03S",
  "and others had tested",
  "the panoramic monitor",
  "and \"linear seat,\" which",
  "were perfected",
  "in this Hizack.",
  "The linear seat, showing the",
  "view on a 360-degree screen,",
  "did not merely",
  "extend visibility;",
  "it unified the Federation and",
  "Zeon control systems, and, as a",
  "linear field--an application of",
  "magnetic coating--isolated it",
  "from the frame,",
  "it also had the property",
  "of absorbing shock.",
  "What's more, the linear seat's",
  "spherical pod",
  "doubled as",
  "an escape pod;",
  "it was cheaper than",
  "the old Core Fighter,",
  "and far safer",
  "than an ejection seat.",
  "If the Gundam is the machine that",
  "appears at each turning point",
  "of high-end MS,",
  "the Zaku may be called the one",
  "at each turning point of",
  "mass-produced, everyday MS.",
  "Being that kind of machine,",
  "it was widely loved by the troops.",
  "This mobile suit was the opposite",
  "of the Gundam Mk-II, which",
  "used only Federation technology",
  "for political reasons.",
  "At the same time, it is also true",
  "that some felt a superstitious",
  "unease at this picture:",
  "the Federation's \"Zaku\" battling",
  "the \"Gundam\" of a group against",
  "the Earth Federation government.",
  "Emma",
  "\"Unit 3! Don't do anything rash!\"",
  "Quattro",
  "\"This is bad, Kamille!\"",
  "Kamille",
  "\"It was you! My mother...!\"",
  "Jerid",
  "\"Your mother!?",
  " What are you talking about!?",
  " You punk!\"",
  "took Kamille's parents hostage.",
  "It was sheer madness, but",
  "as Char would have it, it was",
  "\"nothing to be surprised about\"",
  "in the least.",
  "Such was the unvarnished reality",
  "of an Earth Sphere whose",
  "social order had collapsed.",
  "And after seeing Kamille's mother",
  "die inside the capsule,",
  "Emma Sheen,",
  "a gentle woman,",
  "could not possibly return",
  "to the Titans.",
  "\"Mother...",
  " ...You said mother!?\"",
  "The young Jerid Messa",
  "was a kind man by nature.",
  "Bask had told him the capsule",
  "holding Kamille's mother was",
  "a powerful bomb.",
  "Meant to destroy the Gundam Mk-II",
  "to preserve secrecy, he said.",
  "So without a second thought,",
  "Jerid shot the capsule.",
  "\"You! You! It was you!\"",
  "\"Whoa!?\"",
  "Not knowing",
  "what had happened,",
  "he could only submit",
  "to Kamille's fury.",
  "One cannot simply write Jerid off",
  "as a man lacking imagination.",
  "Civil war or not,",
  "taking hostages",
  "was not a sane idea,",
  "and sniping civilians with a mobile",
  "suit was something",
  "nowhere to be found",
  "in the Titans curriculum.",
  "Though he did not want to believe",
  "it, faced with the capsule that",
  "never exploded,",
  "and the tearful voice",
  "of the boy Kamille striking at him,",
  "Jerid was seized by revulsion:",
  "he had shot an unarmed person.",
  "But Jerid was not flexible enough",
  "to change sides as Emma had.",
  "He chose to believe that",
  "the revulsion heaving in his chest",
  "was born of a plot by the AEUG,",
  "those Zeon remnants.",
  "When a person suddenly realizes",
  "he is sane amid a band of madmen,",
  "he can only run away,",
  "or else give himself over",
  "to the madness.",
  "Jerid chose the latter,",
  "and forever parted ways with his",
  "old friend, who chose the former.",
  "\"Orders to withdraw...!?",
  " With one more chance,",
  " I could redeem myself...!\"",
  "\"But what is it...",
  " this unpleasant feeling...!?\"",
  "Had Jerid looked into that",
  "displeasure a bit more closely,",
  "his fate",
  "might have turned out",
  "a little differently.",
  "But history knows no \"if,\"",
  "and time marches on without mercy."
 ]
}
